WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Grandpa in the third year after you left

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,160
Grandma left not long after

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:07,270
My mother got into a car accident when I was fourteen and it was all my fault.

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,140
If I hadn't left the country willfully

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,620
Nothing will happen to them

6
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,110
It has nothing to do with you

7
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:18,140
You can't change anything here, at least

8
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,150
I won't let you grow up alone, auntie

9
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,470
You just said that you discovered the loss virus abroad

10
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,510
She was lurking in front of Mo's family

11
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,710
I led the team to study her

12
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:30,350
Wait until I realize I can't control it at all

13
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,670
I'll fly back to China immediately to find you.

14
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:33,030
But as soon as the plane lands

15
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,790
The virus broke out

16
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,150
You are still engaged in research

17
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,910
I'm Annette, the famous virus scientist

18
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:40,750
The only woman among the top ten ruthless men

19
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,150
Puppet Master can hypnotize loss

20
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:46,180
The love department is Xia Baobao who was caught by her. What happened to you?
